; RECTANG (0.8.1-PT35, #932): Esc at every prompt leaves no entity, also after an option; the
; aliases REC and RECTANGLE; one undo step Rectang, U and REDO. The Esc cases change no mode
; (Chamfer, Elevation, Fillet, Thickness, Width, Rotation), so no "Current rectangle modes" line.
RECTANG
!esc
REC
0,0
!esc
RECTANGLE
0,0
A
!esc
RECTANG
0,0
A
600
!esc
RECTANG
0,0
D
!esc
RECTANG
0,0
D
40
!esc
RECTANG
0,0
R
!esc
RECTANG
0,0
R
P
0,0
!esc
!report
RECTANG
0,0
40,20
!report
U
!report
REDO
